<title>MOZAMBIQUE: PRESS DIGEST - Mozambique - Feb 12.</title>
<headline>PRESS DIGEST - Mozambique - Feb 12.</headline>
<dateline>MAPUTO 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>These are the leading stories in the Mozambican press on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Reuters has not verified these stories and does not vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>- - - -</p>
<p>NOTICIAS</p>
<p>- The ruling Frelimo party is planning for its seventh annual congress, scheduled for May, to propose that head of state powers be reduced.</p>
<p>- Deputy Prime Minister of Mauritius, Paul Berenger, accompanied by a business delegation, arrived in Maputo on Tuesday for talks with government leaders on investment opportunities in Mozambique.</p>
</text>
